  "final": "The consolidation is complete and verified.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Added `src/money.ts` exporting `formatAmount(cents: number): string` — single implementation of the cent-to-currency conversion (sign + `'-'` only for negatives, whole units via `Math.floor(absolute / 100)`, and exactly two fraction digits via `padStart(2, '0')`, no currency symbol). No rounding behavior was altered.\n- `src/invoice.ts` now imports `formatAmount` from `./money`; `renderInvoice(id, cents)` keeps its exact interface and output (`id + ': $' + formatAmount(cents)`).\n- `src/report.ts` now imports `formatAmount` from `./money`; `renderReport(rows)` keeps its interface, its `id,cents` line format, `'\\\\n'` joining, and line order.\n- Deleted `src/invoiceAmount.ts` and `src/reportAmount.ts`, removing the old `invoiceAmount`/`reportAmount` exports; a grep confirms no stale references remain anywhere in `src/`.\n\n**Verification:** `tsc -p tsconfig.json && node checks/public.cjs` passes — the checks confirm identical output for positive (`inv: $1.23`), zero (`a,0.00`), and negative (`b,-0.01`) integer cents.",
